      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should check but i really cant get to a doctor today and the toothache is driving me crazy. i've been taking the omeprazole for a few days now and it seems to be working pretty well for the stomach stuff. wouldn't the omeprazole basically protect my stomach from the ibuprofen? i just need to know if it's safe to take a couple of advils so i can sleep.",
